<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech SPT says to propose 10-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Czech SPT says to propose 10-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech telephone operator SPT Telecom a.s. said it will propose a 10-for-one stock split at its annual general meeting on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Each share with a nominal value of 1,000 crowns will be split into 10 shares with a nominal value of 100 crowns,&quot; a proposal submitted to shareholders at the AGM, obtained by Reuters, stated.</p>
